Enhancement: Show throughput (MiB/s) for `restic backup`

`restic backup` now shows a trailing 15-second throughput and an overall
throughput since the start of the operation alongside the live progress
line, and the backup summary line printed when the backup finishes
includes the average throughput since the start of the operation. The
values are reported in IEC units (KiB/s, MiB/s, GiB/s, TiB/s) and the
backup JSON status update adds `current_rate` and `overall_rate` fields
expressed in bytes per second.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/5387
